# Home is tonight's games. s opens one sport's schedule, Tab reaches the sections
# line (Replays, Live TV, Search, Settings), and Esc comes back to Tonight.
# Works before the games finish loading: with no games yet, the sections line is
# the whole list and Tab stays on Replays.
start ^ Tonight
key s => ^ Live sports: choose a sport
key Esc => ^ Tonight
key Tab
key Enter => ^ Replays: choose a sport
key Esc => ^ Tonight
key Right
key Enter => ^ Live TV
key Esc => ^ Tonight
key Right
key Enter => ^ Search
key Esc => ^ Tonight
key Right
key Enter => ^ Settings
key Esc => ^ Tonight
key Left
key Enter => ^ Search
